#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:2
msgid "Lyrical Luth Release Timeline"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:4
msgid ""
"For progress on the development of Lyrical Luth, see `this project board "
"<https://github.com/orgs/ros2/projects/70>`__. For the broad process "
"followed by Lyrical Luth, see the :doc:`process description page <../Release-"
"Process>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:7
msgid ""
"**As soon as possible** - Migrate ROS Rolling to ROS Lyrical's target "
"platforms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:8
msgid ""
"RHEL 10 + Ubuntu 26.04: Migrate as soon as core packages successfully build "
"on both platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:9
msgid "Windows 11: Migrate as soon as we have a green build"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Mon. April 13, 2026** - Alpha + RMW freeze (*Delayed; was originally April "
"6th*)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:12
msgid "Preliminary testing of ROS Base packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:13
msgid "API and feature freeze for RMW provider packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:15
msgid "**Mon. April 20, 2026** - Freeze (*Delayed; was originally April 13th*)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:16
msgid "API and feature freeze for ROS Base packages in Rolling Ridley."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:17
msgid "Only bug fix releases should be made after this point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:18
msgid "New packages can be released."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:20
msgid "**Mon. April 21, 2026** - Branch (*Delayed; was originally April 20th*)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:21
msgid "Branch from Rolling Ridley"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:22
msgid "``rosdistro`` is reopened for Rolling PRs for ROS Base packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:23
msgid ""
"Lyrical development shifts from ``ros-rolling-*`` packages to ``ros-lyrical-"
"*`` packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:25
msgid "**Mon. April 27, 2026** - Beta"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:26
msgid "Updated releases of ROS Desktop packages available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:27
msgid "Call for general testing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:29
msgid "**Thu, April 30, 2026** - Kick off Tutorial Party"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:30
msgid "Open up tutorials for community testing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:32
msgid "**Mon. May 11, 2026** - Release Candidate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:33
msgid "Build release candidate packages up to ROS Desktop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:35
msgid "**Mon. May 18, 2026** - Distro Freeze"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:36
msgid "Freeze all Lyrical branches on all ROS desktop packages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:37
msgid ""
"No pull requests for any Lyrical branch or targeting ``lyrical/distribution."
"yaml`` in ``rosdistro`` repo will be merged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:39
msgid "**Friday May 22nd, 2026** - General Availability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:40
msgid "Release announcement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:41
msgid ""
"ROS desktop packages source freeze is lifted and ``rosdistro`` is reopened "
"for Lyrical pull requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:43
msgid "**May, 2031** - End-of-life"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/lyrical/release-timeline.rst:44
msgid "ROS Lyrical will stop receiving updates - including security updates"
msgstr ""
